  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d5ed36415cf0f2440b5ce99be205695c, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dialogue_Mira
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Game.Runtime::Game.Dialogue.DialogueGraph
  graphId: DLG_MIRA
  entryNodeIds:
  - MIRA_AFTER_MEMORY
  - MIRA_QUEST
  - MIRA_INTRO
  nodes:
  - DialogueId: MIRA_INTRO
    Speaker: Mira
    Text: You are the Queen's soldier. Do not look startled, it is not insight, you are the only person in Avarsha who stands like that.
    RequiredFlags: []
    BlockingFlags:
    - QUEENS_CHARGE_GIVEN
    RequiredMemoryId: 
    RequiredMemoryState: 
    Consequences:
    - Type: 0
      Target: SPOKE_TO_MIRA
      Amount: 0
    Choices: []
    NextDialogueId: 
    Subtitle: 
    VoiceAssetId: 
  - DialogueId: MIRA_QUEST
    Speaker: Mira
    Text: The ruin stone. Yes. I have copied that carving nine times and I have nine different counts, and I am not a careless woman.
    RequiredFlags:
    - QUEENS_CHARGE_GIVEN
    BlockingFlags:
    - FIRST_MEMORY_FOUND
    RequiredMemoryId: 
    RequiredMemoryState: 
    Consequences:
    - Type: 0
      Target: SPOKE_TO_MIRA
      Amount: 0
    Choices:
    - Text: What did you count?
      NextDialogueId: MIRA_COUNT
      RequiredFlags: []
      BlockingFlags: []
      Consequences: []
    - Text: Then I'll count it a tenth time.
      NextDialogueId: MIRA_SEND
      RequiredFlags: []
      BlockingFlags: []
      Consequences: []
    NextDialogueId: 
    Subtitle: 
    VoiceAssetId: 
  - DialogueId: MIRA_COUNT
    Speaker: Mira
    Text: Seven, eight times. Eight, once. I threw that page away, which was the single least scholarly act of my life, and I could not tell you why I did it.
    RequiredFlags: []
    BlockingFlags: []
    RequiredMemoryId: 
    RequiredMemoryState: 
    Consequences: []
    Choices: []
    NextDialogueId: MIRA_SEND
    Subtitle: 
    VoiceAssetId: 
  - DialogueId: MIRA_SEND
    Speaker: Mira
    Text: Go and look. And Ishan - whatever you read there, say it out loud before you walk away from it. Things last longer when they are spoken.
    RequiredFlags: []
    BlockingFlags: []
    RequiredMemoryId: 
    RequiredMemoryState: 
    Consequences: []
    Choices: []
    NextDialogueId: 
    Subtitle: 
    VoiceAssetId: 
  - DialogueId: MIRA_AFTER_MEMORY
    Speaker: Mira
    Text: You said it out loud, did you not. Good. Then there are two of us who cannot quite repeat it, and that is one more than there was yesterday.
    RequiredFlags:
    - FIRST_MEMORY_FOUND
    BlockingFlags: []
    RequiredMemoryId: 
    RequiredMemoryState: 
    Consequences: []
    Choices: []
    NextDialogueId: 
    Subtitle: 
    VoiceAssetId: 
